[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13142.15, "timestamp": "03:39:02", "text": "是的，很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13150.71, "timestamp": "03:39:10", "text": "你知道我，我很重视人，嗯，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13153.269, "timestamp": "03:39:13", "text": "如果我们已经交谈过一次，我觉得我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13155.83, "timestamp": "03:39:15", "text": "他们是朋友，我会主动联系他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13159.59, "timestamp": "03:39:19", "text": "问你还好吗？生活一切都好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13162.79, "timestamp": "03:39:22", "text": "大概就是这样，你觉得你的生活怎么样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13166.07, "timestamp": "03:39:26", "text": "想和我合作吗，伙计？是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13169.429, "timestamp": "03:39:29", "text": "但我感觉从某种意义上说，它可以被视为一种"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13172.87, "timestamp": "03:39:32", "text": "这也是件坏事。就像你的方法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13174.63, "timestamp": "03:39:34", "text": "某人，你们好久没联系了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13176.389, "timestamp": "03:39:36", "text": "如果你请求合作，他们会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13179.83, "timestamp": "03:39:39", "text": "比如，“呃，我不想合作。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13182.15, "timestamp": "03:39:42", "text": "因为我还不认识你。算是吧。但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13184.15, "timestamp": "03:39:44", "text": "即使你只是想打破僵局"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13186.95, "timestamp": "03:39:46", "text": "对于这种合作，有些人感到很自在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13189.11, "timestamp": "03:39:49", "text": "有些人感到不舒服。这就是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13191.59, "timestamp": "03:39:51", "text": "正说着。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13194.67, "timestamp": "03:39:54", "text": "是的。是的。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13198.55, "timestamp": "03:39:58", "text": "嗯，就像过去三个月那样，你"}]